             Set the number of times to retry UDP queries to server to _#.  The
             default is 2.  Unlike ++ttrriieess, this does not include the initial
             query.

     ++[nnoo]rrrrccoommmmeennttss
             Display per-record comments in the output (for example, human-
             readable key information about DNSKEY records).  The default is
             ++rrrrccoommmmeennttss if ++mmuullttiilliinnee mode is active or ++nnoorrrrccoommmmeennttss other‐
